  "question": "Which attraction is nearest when considering the west direction of St. Charles Hotel, Hudson, NY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.782453 42.247259)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.tourism = 'attraction'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 247.5 AND 292.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
